Add or extend CLI functionality so the experiment can be operated without editing source files.

Desired conceptual commands:

ban experiment run ...
ban experiment report ...
ban experiment inspect ...
ban experiment compare ...

Adapt command names to the repository's existing CLI conventions.

Required capabilities:

