Run selected:

- dataset;
- condition(s);
- repetitions;
- deterministic/live mode;
- case limit.

report

Generate aggregate results.

inspect

Inspect a single:

- experiment;
- run;
- case;
- memory interaction.

compare

Compare conditions.

Example:

BAN_COLD -> BAN_MEMORY
BAN_MEMORY -> BAN_MISLEADING_MEMORY

CLI output should remain useful to humans while preserving machine-readable output where appropriate.

